import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 549 | Dual-Track Time Domain | The Law-Anchor Principle of Time Flow Rate","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 549 | Dual-Track Time Domain | The Law-Anchor Principle of Time Flow Rate","no":549,"module":3,"tags":["Dual-Track Time Domain","Law Anchor","Time Flow Rate","Law-First","Authority"],"related":["20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy","24-Anchor-Energy Conduction Path","09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance","89-Temporal-Paradox Prevention Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0549_模块3-双轨时间域-时间流速的法则锚定原理.md","filePath":"en/0549_模块3-双轨时间域-时间流速的法则锚定原理.md"}'),n={name:"en/0549_模块3-双轨时间域-时间流速的法则锚定原理.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,c,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-549-dual-track-time-domain-the-law-anchor-principle-of-time-flow-rate" tabindex="-1">Entry 549 | Dual-Track Time Domain | The Law-Anchor Principle of Time Flow Rate <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-549-dual-track-time-domain-the-law-anchor-principle-of-time-flow-rate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 549 | Dual-Track Time Domain | The Law-Anchor Principle of Time Flow Rate&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 20, 24, 09, 89</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-make-time-flow-rate-obey-law-not-anyone-s-mood" tabindex="-1">Introduction: make time flow rate obey law, not anyone&#39;s mood <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-make-time-flow-rate-obey-law-not-anyone-s-mood" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: make time flow rate obey law, not anyone&#39;s mood&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous entry covered how to compute the flow ratio; this entry answers a more foundational question: <strong>what exactly is this thing called &quot;time flow rate&quot; pinned by?</strong> If this question is not answered, so-called &quot;speeding up time&quot; is just a spell — fast today if you want fast, slow tomorrow if you want slow, then it is liable at any moment to be picked up by some strong one as a predation tool. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s answer is <strong>law anchoring</strong>: time flow rate is not a switch controlled by some person, but written into the law network, a constant range strictly managed by anchor-structure permissions. This entry dissects this anchoring principle.</p><p>Six top-level axioms run through: anti-predation axiom requires time flow rate not become the strong one&#39;s predation tool; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires anchoring permissions fairly open to all beings, not secretly hoarded; collective ascension axiom requires anchoring serve all-civilization iteration; causal self-discipline axiom requires any flow-rate adjustment leave traces, auditable; law-first axiom — this entry is its home court — requires every gear of time flow rate defined first by law, never retcon. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-law-anchoring-means" tabindex="-1">I. What &quot;Law Anchoring&quot; Means <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-law-anchoring-means" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What &quot;Law Anchoring&quot; Means&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law anchoring means: the physical quantity time flow rate is <strong>written into the law network</strong>, becoming a rule constrained by law itself, not some mighty one&#39;s personal ability. It has three features:</p><ol><li><strong>Range fixed</strong>: law only allows flow rate to float within the statutory range (e.g., 10:1 to 1000:1); crossing the boundary is rejected by law itself, no one needed to stop it.</li><li><strong>Permissions tiered</strong>: adjusting flow rate requires corresponding law-anchoring permission; permissions granted by civilizational weight and responsibility (Document 20), not whoever has the biggest fist.</li><li><strong>No private bypass</strong>: any private speed-up bypassing anchoring is identified by the law network as anomaly, immediately triggering temporal-paradox circuit-break (Document 89).</li></ol><p>This turns &quot;adjusting time&quot; from a power privilege into a public operation constrained by law.</p><h2 id="ii-the-three-layer-structure-of-anchoring" tabindex="-1">II. The Three-Layer Structure of Anchoring <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-three-layer-structure-of-anchoring" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Three-Layer Structure of Anchoring&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law anchoring is implemented through a three-layer structure:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>Function</th><th>Analogy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law Layer</td><td>Defines flow rate&#39;s statutory range and boundary-crossing rules</td><td>Statute</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor Layer</td><td>Holds and verifies law-anchoring permissions</td><td>Law-enforcement organ</td></tr><tr><td>Conduction Layer</td><td>Actually applies calibrated flow rate to the isolated domain</td><td>Execution device</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three layers connected by the anchor-energy conduction path (Document 24). The law layer says &quot;how fast may one go&quot;; the anchor layer says &quot;are you qualified to adjust&quot;; the conduction layer is responsible for &quot;actually turning the flow rate over.&quot; Any layer failing, flow-rate adjustment cannot complete — this is precisely the structure preventing single-point abuse.</p><h2 id="iii-why-it-must-be-reality-as-foundation" tabindex="-1">III. Why It Must Be &quot;Reality-as-Foundation&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-it-must-be-reality-as-foundation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why It Must Be &quot;Reality-as-Foundation&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law anchoring has another hard constraint: it calibrates <strong>real temporal laws</strong>, not out-of-thin-air illusions. This strictly observes the &quot;Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance&quot; (Document 09): the beings, energy, matter entering the time domain are all real; what is calibrated is only their relative time flow rate. This is critical — if what is anchored is an illusion, then &quot;acceleration&quot; becomes fake experience, deceiving both the individual and civilization&#39;s output; only anchored on reality can the Acceleration Domain&#39;s technical output truly be usable, truly feed back to Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="iv-anchoring-permissions-and-civilizational-weight" tabindex="-1">IV. Anchoring Permissions and Civilizational Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-anchoring-permissions-and-civilizational-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Anchoring Permissions and Civilizational Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Who can apply to adjust higher flow-rate gears depends on their <strong>law-anchoring permission</strong>, and permissions are linked to &quot;civilizational weight&quot; (that individual/civilization&#39;s contribution and responsibility to Myriad-Rank co-building), not to combat power. This is a decisive design: it means the power to adjust time does not reward &quot;who can fight more,&quot; but rewards &quot;who contributes more to co-building, bears more responsibility.&quot; Thus if a strong one wants higher flow-rate gears, the only road is to lift Myriad Ranks, not to predate Myriad Ranks — the power direction is completely reversed.</p><p>Once someone questioned this design &quot;too much trouble, might as well whoever has the biggest fist adjusts.&quot; The sandbox&#39;s answer is crisp: hand the power to adjust time to fists; within three epochs, the Acceleration Domain will become the strong ones&#39; private property; all beings left further and further behind — that is precisely Tang-Luo-style monopoly replayed in time engineering. Law anchoring looks like a few more procedures, but actually swaps monopoly for procedures, swaps the jungle for rules. Slower to get started, but stable enough to use forever.</p><h2 id="v-when-anchoring-fails" tabindex="-1">V. When Anchoring Fails <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-when-anchoring-fails" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. When Anchoring Fails&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law anchoring is not infallible. Once anchor devices drift due to cross-plane interference, the system&#39;s first reaction is not &quot;continue forcing the flow rate,&quot; but immediately slow down, fall back to a safety gear consistent with reality, then the anchor calibration team investigates. This &quot;prefer slow down, not go wrong&quot; downgrade strategy is the most critical fuse in the anchoring design. It acknowledges engineering will fail, so designs the failure cost as &quot;return to origin,&quot; not &quot;run with the error.&quot; Steady is always faster than accurate.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: law anchoring locks flow rate within the statutory range, eliminating law-network overload and energy waste from private overclocking</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the power to adjust time no longer belongs to the biggest fist, but to the biggest co-building contributor, structurally dismantling the possibility of &quot;predating all beings with time&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo strong ones speed up when they want, rewards and punishments at will; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s time flow rate is law-anchored; even the anchor himself cannot cross the boundary</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: law-anchoring permissions open to application by all beings capable of bearing responsibility; before civilizational weight, Myriad Ranks equal</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: anchoring three-layer structure, permission and civilizational-weight conversion rules, boundary-crossing circuit-break thresholds all public</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law-anchor principle of time flow rate answers the foundational question of &quot;who manages time&quot;: not the strongest, but law itself. When time flow rate is written into the law network, strictly managed by anchor permissions, firmly pinned by the reality-as-foundation principle, &quot;fast&quot; is no longer a predatable privilege, but a publicly constrained, contribution-allocated civilizational engineering. The law-first axiom here is not a slogan, but lets the beast of time for the first time wear law&#39;s reins.</p><p>In the final analysis, the law-anchor principle of time flow rate described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./20-锚点结构与层级.html">20-Anchor Structure and Hierarchy</a> · <a href="./24-锚点能量传导路径.html">24-Anchor-Energy Conduction Path</a> · <a href="./09-现实为基根本立场.html">09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance</a> · <a href="./89-时间悖论防控机制.html">89-Temporal-Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
